"P1106679349" "This list of targets certainly looks like it came from Crey Industries. Crimson Revenant thoerizes that after you take out the first target and plant the list, Mynx will arrive to save the second."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeOneClue 
