"P3023445131" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>The key to hero hunting, {VillainName}, is to make your quarry come to you.</A> Ergo, you will go to Mynx's new stomping grounds and stage a Crey crime in progress. When the lady arrives, as she inevitably will, you will be prepared."
// AcceptString :
"P1641667315" "Make Mynx come to you"
// SendOffString :
"P3425144428" "We know Mynx is operating in Primeva, and we know she's hunting Crey. So to bring her to you, you're going to make it look like Crey has committed a terrible crime. I want you to tear a swath through one of the Longbow bases in Primeva. Take these papers. They'll make it look like Crey security did this deed, and they'll also set up a rendezvous."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P247600577" "Defeat all agents in base"
